    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Alex. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769453619266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return the VeloBand tracker I bought.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 17443,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769453623799999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Can I get your name and order number to pull up your account?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769453627133332
    },
    {
      "text": "Maria Garcia. Order number is 54B-1129.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 17443,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769453634066665
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Maria. I see the order here, delivered on December 15th. To make sure I understand correctly, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769453636866665
    },
    {
      "text": "It works. I just changed my mind.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 17443,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769453649399998
