      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769453651799998
    },
    {
      "text": "No. It was an impulse buy, and to be honest, I just don't use it. I was about to list it for resale but figured I should check with you first.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 17443,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769453655933331
    },
    {
      "text": "I appreciate you checking. One moment while I review the return eligibility for your order.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769453665599997
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, thank you for waiting. I've checked the policy, and since your VeloBand was delivered less than 10 days ago, it is still eligible for a full refund.",
